\newlabel{fig:unet}{{5}{7}{The AnimateDiff U-Net. Every block pairs spatial layers (one frame at a time) with a temporal motion module (all 16 frames at one position). The whole pass runs at each of the 25 denoising steps. Block names in the text follow diffusers (\texttt {down\_blocks.0} \ldots \texttt {up\_blocks.3}); \texttt {up\_blocks.0} is the 8$\times $8 decoder block right after the bottleneck.\relax }{figure.caption.5}{}}
