\newlabel{fig:h1h2}{{8}{14}{Left: motion selectivity $M(b)$ of the nine temporal blocks with 95\% CIs; only \texttt {up\_blocks.0} is above zero. Right: the motion-selectivity profile of \texttt {up0.mm2} over the denoising steps, with the fitted changepoint and its CI.\relax }{figure.caption.9}{}}
