\newlabel{fig:probes}{{9}{15}{Verb-probe accuracy over the denoising steps on four coordinates, trained on one scene and tested on the other (chance 0.25). $\xs $ decodes the verb at least as well as $\xd $ everywhere.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
